{"source":{"uri":"Features/013_CP_Smoke_Test_AZ.feature","data":"@CLDC @CLDC_smoke_test @smoke_test @CP @CP_smoke\r\n\r\nFeature: CP Smoke Test\r\n  As a Commercial Lines Duck Creek policy processing user\r\n  I want to complete the CP Smoke Test workflow\r\n  So that the business transaction is executed with source-traceable data and verification\r\n\r\n  Background: Prepare Commercial Lines Duck Creek for policy processing\r\n    Given I open a browser session\r\n  Scenario Outline: CP Smoke Test - <stateCode>\r\n    Given test data \"<dataFile>\" and external data \"<externalDataFile>\" are loaded\r\n    And I open the configured Commercial Lines Duck Creek application\r\n    And I sign in to Commercial Lines Duck Creek using configured credentials\r\n    And I start a new quote\r\n    And I enter individual client information\r\n    And I complete required policy information\r\n    And I navigate to Policy Info and Verify Desc\r\n\r\n    Examples:\r\n      | dataFile | stateCode | stateVariant | stateName | externalDataFile |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_az.json | AZ | AZ | Arizona | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_ct.json | CT | CT | Connecticut | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_de.json | DE | DE | Delaware | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_ma.json | MA | MA | Massachusetts | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_md.json | MD | MD | Maryland | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_me.json | ME | ME | Maine | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_nh.json | NH | NH | New Hampshire | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_nj.json | NJ | NJ | New Jersey | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_ny.json | NY | NY | New York | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_or.json | OR | OR | Oregon | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_pa.json | PA | PA | Pennsylvania | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_ri.json | RI | RI | Rhode Island | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_va.json | VA | VA | Virginia | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_vt.json | VT | VT | Vermont | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_wa.json | WA | WA | Washington | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n      | TestData/Scenarios/013_cp_smoke_test_wv.json | WV | WV | West Virginia | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
